# XM-FXII — Made by Veniek

An experimental Windows music tracker based on FastTracker II clone.

Includes channel effects, eight-band EQ, drawn automation,
and a stereo master with compression and a live spectrum.

Created by Veniek (Kees van der Ven, Netherlands) from a personal
need to combine the FastTracker workflow with modern effects.

Private test version. Not an official FastTracker II clone release.
